sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller
    participant Dashboard
    participant Retell as Retell agent
    participant API as FastAPI calendar
    participant DB as SQLite

    Caller->>Dashboard: Start web call
    Dashboard->>API: POST /api/web-calls
    API->>Retell: Create Web Call
    Retell-->>API: Call credentials and call_id
    API-->>Dashboard: Safe client session data
    Dashboard->>Retell: Join voice session

    Caller->>Retell: Ask for a dental appointment
    Retell->>API: check_availability(date)
    API->>DB: Read open slots
    DB-->>API: Available slots
    API-->>Retell: Speakable slots with stable IDs
    Retell-->>Caller: Offer available times

    Caller->>Retell: Select and confirm a slot
    Retell->>API: book_appointment(call_id, slot, patient)
    API->>API: Derive idempotency key
    API->>DB: Transactionally create appointment
    DB-->>API: APT-001 created
    API-->>Retell: APT-001 confirmed
    Retell-->>Caller: Confirm appointment once

    Dashboard->>API: Poll sanitized events
    API->>DB: Read demo evidence
    DB-->>API: 1 attempt and 1 appointment
    API-->>Dashboard: Normal booking result
